.TH "RAPTOR-LIBRARY" 1 "2026-10" "RAPTOR Studio" "RAPTOR Studio Manual"
.SH NAME
raptor\-library \- A part type is a block's data without identity or placement; a library is a plain JSON file of them. Applying one writes ordinary block columns and records a link, so the model stays a normal model. The model file changes only for apply/save/detach.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBraptor library\fR [\-h] ACTION ...
.SH DESCRIPTION
A part type is a block's data without identity or placement; a library is a plain JSON file of them. Applying one writes ordinary block columns and records a link, so the model stays a normal model. The model file changes only for apply/save/detach.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBraptor\fR(1)
